msgid "Key"
msgstr "Chiave"

#: app/admin/templates/backups.html:105
msgid "created on the server with <span class=\"mono\">docker compose exec -it gateway cups-policy-admin backup-key</span>: the passphrase never goes through the portal"
msgstr "creata sul server con <span class=\"mono\">docker compose exec -it gateway cups-policy-admin backup-key</span>: la passphrase non passa mai dal portale"

#: app/admin/templates/backups.html:107
msgid "Without encryption the file contains the database (users, names of printed files). That is why the secrets are <b>not</b> saved: the TLS key, <span class=\"mono\">SECRET_KEY</span> and the RADIUS secret must be kept separately."
msgstr "Senza cifratura il file contiene il database (utenti, nomi dei file stampati). Per questo <b>non</b> vengono salvati i segreti: chiave TLS, <span class=\"mono\">SECRET_KEY</span> e segreto RADIUS vanno conservati a parte."

