msgid "The easiest way: <a href=\"/me/print\">Print a file</a> (PDF, photo, text) and <a href=\"/me/scan\">Scan</a>, without installing or configuring anything. Alternatively on Android: <b>Mopria Print Service</b>, which shows the printers and asks for the name and key."
